rification history.</span></div></div><div class="payment-guide-brand"><?php if($logo):?><img src="<?=e($logo)?>" alt="Foundation logo"><?php else:?><span>97</span><?php endif;?><div><b>Gateway verification guide</b><small>Use this checklist when a payment stays in Pending or Processing.</small></div></div><ol class="payment-guide-steps"><li>Make sure Merchant ID, Merchant Secret, API App ID and App Secret are configured in <b>Developer Integration → Payment Gateway</b>.</li><li>Confirm the gateway callback/webhook URL is reachable in the active environment.</li><li>Use <b>Verify Status with Gateway</b> to sync the latest payment result from the provider.</li><li>Once verified, the status updates automatically to Successful, Failed, Cancelled or Refunded.</li></ol><div class="verification-audit-list"><?php foreach($events as $e):?><div><span class="<?=$e['verified']?'ok':'bad'?>"><?=$e['verified']?'✓':'!'?></span><p><b><?=e($e['gateway'])?> callback · code <?=e($e['status_code'])?></b><small><?=e(date('d M Y · h:i:s A',strtotime($e['received_at'])))?></small></p></div><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$events):?><p class="empty">No gateway callback received yet. If the donor has completed checkout, use <b>Verify Status with Gateway</b> after confirming your API credentials and callback URL.</p><?php endif;?></div></section><?php if($tx['status']==='successful'&&$tx['gateway_payment_id']):?><section class="admin-panel refund-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Refund Payment</h3><span>Full refund only · requires Merchant API credentials and provider authorization.</span></div></div><form method="post" action="<?=url('admin/online-payments/refund')?>" class="admin-form"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$tx['id']?>"><label class="full"><span>Reason</span><input name="description" maxlength="240" value="Donor refund" required></label><button class="danger-link full" type="submit" data-confirm="Send this refund request to the payment provider?">Request Refund</button></form></section><?php endif;?></aside></div>
